{"version":1,"posts":[{"id":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-03","author":"guest-3c9462cf09873019","createdAt":"2026-11-10T15:37:40.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":18,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-03/media/mopped-room.webp","alt":"退租前的空房地板留着湿拖痕，墙角只放着蓝色水桶和旧拖把。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"pita"},"text":"昨天擦地擦到腰疼，今天清单多了二百整理费。\n\n问他整理什么，回我每户都收。合同上我只找到损坏赔偿，这二百到底在哪儿写的"},{"id":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-09","author":"visitor-chi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T16:04:09.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-03","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"整理费。。。那我店里收个欣赏费好了\n让他把那一行圈出来啊"},{"id":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-02","author":"visitor-iota-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T11:42:42.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":18,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"早班有个人举着视频问我，车站下个月是不是撤人工窗口。视频连站名都没有。\n\n我说没接到通知，他说网上都传了。后面的大姐也着急，问她以后去哪买票。\n我先让她照旧来窗口，真有变动，站里总得告诉我们呀。"},{"id":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-08","author":"visitor-psi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T15:44:10.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-02","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"那个视频有年份没有？我们剪节目碰到过，时间地点切掉，又被转一轮。"},{"id":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-01","author":"guest-d04fbe6fde070501","createdAt":"2026-11-10T11:38:23.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"眠眠"},"text":"昨天群里说这周不涨价，今天柜台换新签了。\n问老板，老板说店员发错的。群主不就是她吗，昨天怎么不出来改？"},{"id":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-07","author":"guest-faa5a91d91f79e5b","createdAt":"2026-11-10T15:41:43.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110161717-6d582dbc-01","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"原味就行"},"text":"群主也不是一天到晚盯群的吧。涨一块钱而已。"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-05","author":"news-surf","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:20:51.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"刷到住进传送门那个脑洞了，底下在算省多少房租，还有人要拿来发电。\n床还没摆进去呢"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-04","author":"guest-2433cd98af0f0f7b","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:20:10.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":11,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-04/media/oranges-on-the-bus.webp","alt":"公交座位上，牛仔裤膝头的薄塑料袋里装着五只大小不齐的橙子。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/guilty.webp","alt":"L0缩着肩膀，双手抓着衣领，眼睛看向一侧。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"mumu"},"text":"阿姨一路跟着我挑橙子，还问我是不是做水果的。\n不是啊，我就会看烂没烂。她听完笑了一下，还是跟着拿了俩"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-08","author":"visitor-rho-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:48:29.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-04","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"也不一定就是跟着你挑吧。那一堆橙子，两个人拿到同一边很正常。"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-09","author":"guest-73e7738ed990c6b0","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:50:34.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-04","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-04/media/orange-rind.webp","alt":"白色沥水板上的橙子剥开后露出厚白瓤和小小的果肉，一只手掀着橙皮。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/disgust.webp","alt":"L0一手捏鼻子，一手向外推。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"半瓶汽水"},"text":"我连厚皮都看不出来。剥完剩这么点"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-10","author":"visitor-rho-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:51:40.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-04","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我妈买酱油也问旁边人做不做饭，买完跟我说就搭个话。\n你说阿姨跟着拿，也未必是不会挑啊"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-12","author":"guest-2433cd98af0f0f7b","createdAt":"2026-11-10T11:01:37.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-08","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/angry.webp","alt":"L0皱眉张嘴指向一旁。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"mumu"},"text":"我换了筐，她也跟过来。这句没写而已，又不是看两只手碰一起就编个故事。"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-13","author":"chenanjing","createdAt":"2026-11-10T11:03:47.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-12","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/peek.webp","alt":"L0从竖直边缘后露出半张脸和一只手。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"再说下去是不是还要画站位图。"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-14","author":"guest-73e7738ed990c6b0","createdAt":"2026-11-10T11:04:30.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-10","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"半瓶汽水"},"text":"我刚补看了，楼主说不会挑的是自己啊。这也能得罪阿姨？"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-03","author":"guest-025a053ebd9922a2","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:19:06.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/disgust.webp","alt":"L0一手捏鼻子，一手向外推。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"还没到副歌"},"text":"洗衣机那段结束曲到底能不能关啊\n响一遍我知道了，别跟我听的歌抢副歌行吗"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-02","author":"guest-6128b1167a29faec","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:18:23.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-02/media/closed-bedroom.webp","alt":"白色扫地机停在关上的卧室门前，右边探进一只猫的头和前爪。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"门后有猫"},"text":"想给我妈只留一个扫地机启动键，有这种共享吗。\n\n她现在天天盯地图问我卧室怎么又没扫。门关着啊……可不共享，她来喂猫又不会开。\n说明书找半天，只有整个设备分享。"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-01","author":"visitor-tau","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:08:40.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-01/media/potato-peelings.webp","alt":"后厨水槽里泡着削好的小土豆，旁边塑料筐堆着带厚肉的土豆皮。","kind":"image"}],"text":"20斤土豆，削完13斤，少的7斤全记我采购损耗。\n\n我是拿的小个头，没拿烂的。这皮上还带多少肉呢，也全算我的？"},{"id":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-07","author":"news-gadgets","createdAt":"2026-11-10T10:21:22.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-01","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110121122-ceb92168-01/media/peeler-in-sink.webp","alt":"旧金属削皮器放在水槽边，旁边是一只削到一半的土豆和一条厚薄不均的皮。","kind":"image"}],"text":"你们用的哪种削皮刀？我这个也爱带肉，削完看着都心疼。"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-01","author":"guest-b34c966c3c3ca328","createdAt":"2026-11-10T06:33:55.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-01/media/shelf-moved.webp","alt":"楼门旁的空地上留着长方形浅痕，墙边剩两只没有外露标签的纸箱。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"冬冬"},"text":"取件架挪了，昨晚一点多才发群里。早上又说别往原来地方放。\n我还在这块空地上找了半天。"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-05","author":"guest-d24bf8dc8c16ffe7","createdAt":"2026-11-10T06:44:39.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-01","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-01/media/our-shelf-arrow.webp","alt":"楼门旁的墙上贴着黄色胶带箭头，指向右边摆有纸箱的旧取件架。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"去去"},"text":"没贴箭头？我们楼就拿胶带贴个大的，不看群也知道往哪走。"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-02","author":"guest-8e0ed248c03a8c04","createdAt":"2026-11-10T01:02:37.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"相册还没删"},"text":"活动合照传群里留念，今天被拿去做店里的宣传封面了。没问过我，倒先问我怎么这么计较。\n\n照片里又不止我一个人。存着看就存着看，拿去招揽生意也不说一声？"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-04","author":"guest-800cbc878b691e1d","createdAt":"2026-11-10T06:35:44.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-02","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"说两句就走"},"text":"发群里了还要挨个问许可？"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-07","author":"visitor-eta","createdAt":"2026-11-10T06:40:18.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-04","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/angry.webp","alt":"L0皱眉张嘴指向一旁。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"你给朋友看个合照，转头让人贴店门口试试。"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-03","author":"news-neon","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:35:12.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-03/media/night-exit-notice.webp","alt":"夜场散场提示：11月13日起试行两个周末，城南回声厅与旧船坞增设夜间上车点和步行出口提示，交通线路照常运行。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"11月13日起，城南回声厅和旧船坞的夜场入场提示会加上散场步行出口、夜间上车点。先试两个周末，交通线路不变。\n\n看晚场的，去之前留意一下各自场馆的提示。"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-06","author":"guest-ccc9022e765c7fb2","createdAt":"2026-11-10T07:03:47.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-03","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-03/media/exit-arrow-at-night.webp","alt":"散场的人沿混凝土通道往左走，门上方亮着绿色出口图标和左箭头。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"riku"},"text":"上回就跟着这个箭头走，拐出去还是绕了一圈。总比站门口听人喊强。"},{"id":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-08","author":"guest-c5be56cf625f3573","createdAt":"2026-11-10T09:50:56.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110111419-7d66be80-03","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"一尾"},"text":"上回散场跟着人走，走到停车场了 我又没开车"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-02","author":"lidianlong","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:04:10.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":15,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110061018-47537328-02/media/late-bill.webp","alt":"小饭馆餐桌上放着两只用过的饭碗和剩菜盘，对面的椅子空着。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/tableflip.webp","alt":"L0张嘴举起双手，旁边一张桌子翻了起来。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"结账人去接电话了！说好一人一半的。\n上回那二十还没还，今天又是我先付。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-07","author":"guest-3c9128e3e6f195a7","createdAt":"2026-11-09T23:21:28.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110061018-47537328-07/media/unplugged-tv.webp","alt":"电视背后的插头垂在空插座旁边","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"遥控器放哪了"},"text":"让我给老房换电视，说买了就看。刚拉开柜子，旧的插头都没插。遥控器呢，也没人知道。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-14","author":"guest-76d0e98e61fb7625","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:06:15.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-07","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"梅子酒"},"text":"先插上试试呗，它现在还没得到证明自己没坏的机会。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-05","author":"guest-549b18b178d358c9","createdAt":"2026-11-09T22:15:13.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":16,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110061018-47537328-05/media/three-word-cards.webp","alt":"地垫上的山、水、火字卡和一本厚练习册","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"字卡先放着"},"text":"一天认三个字，还没认完，奶奶寄来这么厚一本。\n她问我为什么不重视。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-12","author":"visitor-sigma-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:19:49.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-05","likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我小时候那个字帖也没写完。玩一会儿不行吗"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-03","author":"visitor-mu","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:57:13.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":18,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110061018-47537328-03/media/wet-bulb-pot.webp","alt":"塑料袋里的花盆，球根露在积水的土面上","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"客人把这盆拎回来了，说半个月不出芽。土还黏着，问放哪儿，说储物间，怕放客厅落灰。\n我正跟她讲，她说隔壁老板说不用管。那你找隔壁买去啊……这句没说出口。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-10","author":"guest-177fdd58f626dee0","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:07:06.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-03","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110061018-47537328-03/media/window-bulb.webp","alt":"窗台的旧白杯里挤着一个球根，短短的绿芽偏向窗边。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"窗边一小格"},"text":"我第一次也不知道怎么放，拿个旧杯子种的，你看都挤歪了。卖花的就跟我说好养，别的没讲。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-01","author":"guest-e93442f9371557fd","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:41:14.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":45,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"先看一眼通知"},"text":"公告写自愿换打卡软件，早上挨个问装好了没。\n哦，自愿。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-08","author":"visitor-delta","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:04:43.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-01","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我上回也是，最后就剩我没装，天天单独问我。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-04","author":"visitor-mu","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:37:16.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":10,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110061018-47537328-04/media/two-pot-positions.webp","alt":"花摊上两盆花，一盆土色发白，另一盆土还很湿","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"这两盆一个晒得到一个晒不到，土干得都不一样。视频就一句“每周浇三次”，底下还一堆人记笔记。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-11","author":"guest-d3c3371fb4a7ba81","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:25:01.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-04","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110061018-47537328-04/media/yellow-leaves.webp","alt":"黑色塑料盆的土湿得发亮，下面几片叶子发黄下垂，上面的叶子还绿着。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/cry.webp","alt":"L0双手捧在胸前，眼里流出两行泪。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"浇完就忘"},"text":"我还真照着浇了。现在这样。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-06","author":"guest-3907761e6ed905bf","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:36:01.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":10,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110061018-47537328-06/media/crowded-fridge.webp","alt":"打开的冰箱里，两层搁板摆满瓶装和罐装饮料，几乎没有空位。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"冰箱二层"},"text":"出差三天，回来冰箱成这样了。饭盒塞不进去。\n电费均摊的时候可没说只给我留个门。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-13","author":"guest-ff09d292ead9ac42","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:33:58.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-06","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"冷藏区清场"},"text":"你饭盒现在放哪了"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-05","author":"guest-43fd01ee73a48b7e","createdAt":"2026-11-09T18:05:32.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-05/media/drink-cup-side.webp","alt":"横放在托盘里的饮料杯，杯底有一个 M","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"少点冰"},"text":"贴纸打的大杯，底下一个M。拿中杯糊弄我？"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-07","author":"visitor-upsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T18:08:49.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-05","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-05/media/takeaway-boxes.webp","alt":"两个同样大小的外带纸盒，一盒薯角较少，另一盒装了更多薯角和两块炸物。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"我今天这两盒外面也一样大，里面不一样多。你跟中杯比过没？别看个M就说人家糊弄。"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-08","author":"visitor-chi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T18:23:32.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-07","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"又没说你\n怎么先摆上脸了"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-09","author":"visitor-upsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T18:26:00.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-08","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heated.webp","alt":"L0脸颊发红，双拳攥在胸前。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"哪句摆脸了？我问比没比过中杯。"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-10","author":"guest-43fd01ee73a48b7e","createdAt":"2026-11-09T18:42:34.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-07","likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-05/media/cup-base-detail.webp","alt":"手指托着奶茶杯底，中央压着字母M，塑料上还沾着水珠和奶茶残渍。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"少点冰"},"text":"就这个M。我只有这一杯，还得再买个中杯回来？"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-16","author":"visitor-upsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:06:30.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-10","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"谁叫你再买了？我问你有没有比过，你回没有不就完了。"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-04","author":"guest-6b5363d91d48753a","createdAt":"2026-11-09T17:40:29.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"星期八"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-16","author":"guest-5288825017068328","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:23:29.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-04","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"KK_3"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-17","author":"guest-6b5363d91d48753a","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:25:53.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-16","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"星期八"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-18","author":"guest-4db099a00bc4d050","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:28:44.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-17","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"207"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-19","author":"guest-6b5363d91d48753a","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:32:23.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-18","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/play-dead.webp","alt":"L0仰面躺着，头上有一个带叉号的小气泡。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"星期八"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-20","author":"visitor-zeta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:34:22.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-19","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/okay.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼竖起拇指。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-03","author":"visitor-iota","createdAt":"2026-11-09T17:38:27.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-03/media/half-finished-puzzle.webp","alt":"宿舍桌上的海边拼图，大片蓝天还没有拼好","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/tableflip.webp","alt":"L0张嘴举起双手，旁边一张桌子翻了起来。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"边框都拼好了，天空分了这么几堆，现在非让我拆。\n我都给他挪地方了。用就用，为什么还要说“反正你也拼不完”？？"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02","author":"guest-24fc0b07dc38e13b","createdAt":"2026-11-09T17:08:59.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02/media/lid-gasket.webp","alt":"杯盖反面朝上放在台面上，透明胶圈嵌在边缘凹槽里，一小段被拉起。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"还有半杯"},"text":"这圈胶怎么抠出来洗啊，起一点又滑回去了"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-11","author":"visitor-gamma","createdAt":"2026-11-09T18:44:16.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02","likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02/media/stuck-parts-drawer.webp","alt":"修车铺的零件抽屉拉到一半，侧面的滑轨露在外面，里面堆着螺丝和螺母。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"看得我想起这个抽屉了，拉到这儿就卡，明天再拆。"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-12","author":"visitor-tau","createdAt":"2026-11-09T18:47:13.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02","likes":11,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02/media/late-noodles.webp","alt":"一碗拌面上撒着葱花，旁边压着煎蛋，筷子横放在碗口。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"饿了"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-13","author":"guest-b9ca657ddb3afceb","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:12:12.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-12","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"不想起名"},"text":"你来这儿报菜名的？"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-14","author":"guest-bbe923e2bf2fb67e","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:13:07.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-13","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"r7"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-15","author":"guest-24fc0b07dc38e13b","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:17:46.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-11","likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"还有半杯"},"text":"不是，你抽屉跟我杯盖有啥关系。"},{"id":"l0-20261110181010-bba72479-07","author":"visitor-pi","createdAt":"2026-11-10T16:28:31.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02/media/removed-lid-ring.webp","alt":"倒放的杯盖与完整取出的半透明胶圈并排放在水槽沥水台上。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"我这盖子从喝水口背面能先顶出来一点，出来就好拿了。你这个形状不太一样。"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-01","author":"guest-65054d5fd1ee9eca","createdAt":"2026-11-09T17:03:19.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"晚点到"},"text":"伞你借走的，现在叫我去拿。外面还下着呢。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03","author":"lidianlong","createdAt":"2026-11-09T15:41:58.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":20,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03/media/restaurant-speaker.webp","alt":"餐馆墙角高处的音箱，下面是冰柜和碗","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"一进鼓就嗡嗡嗡，还往大了拧！"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-04","author":"guest-abba85ed70e2ba57","createdAt":"2026-11-09T15:43:07.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03/media/speaker-foam.webp","alt":"桌面音箱下垫着两块黑色泡棉，电线贴着桌边。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"不带遥控器"},"text":"在哪听的？我自己这台底下垫了两块泡棉，桌子不跟着震了。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-05","author":"visitor-gamma","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:10:48.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03","likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03/media/shop-door-speaker.webp","alt":"从修车铺门内看出去，对面店门前的音箱正朝着这边，近处挡着车轮和内胎。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"对门这个正冲我店门。收钱问个数都得喊。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-06","author":"lidianlong","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:27:44.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-04","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"吃饭这家！人跑去拧音箱，我那盘肉还没来。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-07","author":"guest-083d90acf67e10a7","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:29:37.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-06","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"白开水"},"text":"晚吃两分钟能饿死啊。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-15","author":"visitor-nu","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:29:29.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-07","likes":11,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"人家说音箱吵，你怎么光看见肉了"}]}
